{"t":"MDLZ","made":"2026-11-26 02:57","name":"Mondelez International, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Confectioners","employees":91000,"hq":"Chicago, IL, United States","website":"https://www.mondelezinternational.com","summary_en":"Mondelez International, Inc., through its subsidiaries, manufactures, markets, and sells snack food and beverage products in Latin America, North America, Asia, the Middle East, Africa, and Europe. The company provides biscuits and baked snacks, including cookies, crackers, salted snacks, snack bars, and cakes and pastries; chocolates; and gums and candies, as well as various cheese, grocery, and powdered beverage products. Its brand portfolio includes Oreo, Ritz, LU, CLIF Bar, Tate's Bake Shop biscuits and baked snacks, Cadbury Dairy Milk, Milka, and Toblerone chocolate. It serves supermarket chains, wholesalers, supercenters, club stores, mass merchandisers, distributors, convenience stores, gasoline stations, drug stores, value stores, and other retail food outlets through direct store delivery, company-owned and satellite warehouses, distribution centers, third-party distributors, and other facilities, as well as through independent sales offices and agents. The company also sells products directly to businesses and consumers through e-retail platforms, retailer digital platforms, as well as through its direct-to-consumer websites and social media platforms. Mondelez International, Inc. was formerly known as Kraft Foods Inc. and changed its name to Mondelez International, Inc. in October 2012. The company was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Chicago, Illinois.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Mondelez International, Inc.는 자회사를 통해 라틴 아메리카, 북미, 아시아, 중동, 아프리카 및 유럽에서 스낵 식품 및 음료 제품을 제조, 판매 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 쿠키, 크래커, 소금에 절인 스낵, 스낵바, 케이크 및 페이스트리를 포함한 비스킷과 구운 스낵을 제공합니다. 초콜릿; 껌, 사탕, 다양한 치즈, 식료품, 분말 음료 제품 등이 있습니다. 브랜드 포트폴리오에는 Oreo, Ritz, LU, CLIF Bar, Tate's Bake Shop 비스킷 및 구운 스낵, Cadbury Dairy Milk, Milka 및 Toblerone 초콜릿이 포함됩니다. 이는 직접 매장 배송, 회사 소유 및 위성 창고, 유통 센터, 제3자 유통업체 및 기타 시설을 통해 슈퍼마켓 체인점, 도매업체, 슈퍼센터, 클럽 매장, 대량 판매점, 유통업체, 편의점, 주유소, 약국, 가치 상점 및 기타 소매 식품 매장에 서비스를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 독립 판매 사무소 및 대리점을 통해 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 전자 소매 플랫폼, 소매업체 디지털 플랫폼은 물론 소비자 직접 웹사이트와 소셜 미디어 플랫폼을 통해 기업과 소비자에게 직접 제품을 판매합니다. Mondelez International, Inc.는 이전에 Kraft Foods Inc.로 알려졌으며 2012년 10월에 Mondelez International, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 2000년에 법인화되었으며 일리노이주 시카고에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":68.19,"mcap":86317522944.0,"pe":21.511042,"fpe":20.278227,"peg":0.9742,"ps":2.1634548,"pb":3.2552035,"ev_ebitda":14.656,"div":3.1,"beta":0.356,"hi52":68.92,"lo52":51.2},"fin":{"rev":39898001408.0,"rev_g":0.023,"eps_g":0.789,"gross":0.3426,"op":0.14567,"net":0.10221,"roe":0.15478,"fcf":2783624960.0,"cash":1628000000.0,"debt":22333999104.0,"de":83.777,"eps":3.17,"feps":3.36272},"own":{"short":0.028099999,"inst":0.88817,"insider":0.00336},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":70.63636,"median":72.0,"high":77.0,"low":56.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.82609,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":11,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":11,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":11,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":10,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-31","Firm":"Freedom Broker","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":71.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":75.0,"priorPriceTarget":70.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"BNP Paribas","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":72.0,"priorPriceTarget":70.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight